#~ shadowed_header
# fixedbugs, defect 2428, lane b30-shadow, 2026-11-10 (panel 243's R2, the
# lane's reading): a folder `pkg-config` answers is its library's only where
# nothing else names it. Here the `.pc` names the program's own folder, so its
# `sys/timeb.h`, read by the program's `own.h` through the angle form, is the
# program's file, judged as one: refused, its note telling the folder as the
# program's own, which the author can rename or move, never as the
# library's; this line is its mark.

extern "own.h" pkgconfig "p2428"
    constant TIMEB_LIB: i64

function main()
    print(TIMEB_LIB)
